      "text": "Jews … which believe … are all zealous of the law, Acts 21:20. I … was zealous toward God, Acts 22:3. they have a zeal of God, Rom. 10:2. your zeal hath provoked very many, 2 Cor. 9:2. zealous of the traditions of my fathers, Gal. 1:14. good to be zealously affected always in a good thing, Gal. 4:18. Concerning zeal, persecuting the church, Philip. 3:6. he hath a great zeal for you, Col. 4:13. a peculiar people, zealous of good works, Titus 2:14. we ought to give the more earnest heed to the things, Heb. 2:1. be zealous therefore, and repent, Rev. 3:19.",
